OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of occasional showers and
OL,7,Fsome clearer interludes this evening
OL,8,Fand tonight. Fresh to strong southerly
OL,9,Fwinds through the evening will ease
OL,10,Fslightly overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FRather cloudy morning for
OL,13,FOrkney with a few showers. Drier
OL,14,Fsunnier conditions over Shetland will
OL,15,Fthen spread south into Orkney in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Moderate southerly winds
OL,17,Fbacking northwesterly later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
